### 1. Listar todos los animes (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animes
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obtener anime por ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animes/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Obtener Mashup + API Externa + Calculadora Social + Caché (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animes/mashup
Accept: application/json

### 4. Crear nuevo anime válido (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/animes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Jujutsu Kaisen",
  "capitulosVistos": 47,
  "saltaRelleno": true,
  "puntuacionPersonal": 9.2,
  "plataformas": ["Crunchyroll", "Netflix"],
  "aceptaRiesgoSocial": true
}

### 5. Provocar error de validación @Valid (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/animes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "",
  "capitulosVistos": -10,
  "saltaRelleno": true,
  "puntuacionPersonal": 15.0,
  "plataformas": [],
  "aceptaRiesgoSocial": false
}

### 6. Provocar conflicto de unicidad SQL (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/animes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Naruto Shippuden",
  "capitulosVistos": 10,
  "saltaRelleno": false,
  "puntuacionPersonal": 8.0,
  "plataformas": ["Netflix"],
  "aceptaRiesgoSocial": true
}

### 7. Reemplazar anime completo con PUT (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/animes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Naruto Shippuden Completo",
  "capitulosVistos": 500,
  "saltaRelleno": true,
  "puntuacionPersonal": 9.8,
  "plataformas": ["Crunchyroll", "Prime Video"],
  "aceptaRiesgoSocial": true
}

### 8. Actualización parcial con PATCH (200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/animes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capitulosVistos": 505
}

### 9. Buscar anime inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/animes/9999
Accept: application/json

### 10. Eliminar anime (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/animes/2